  "title": [
    "[The Graveyard Temporalis]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Glowing wisps of virulent mist swirl into the low-lying fog of the area, casting a spectral green glow onto the faces of the large grave monuments scattered here and higher into the tree limbs above that shelter them.  The effect is unnerving at the very least, as the slightest movement of the limbs creates monstrous shapes against the stoic marble, and with the density of ground cover, a person is only ever one step away from tumbling into an unseen grave.  Literally."
  ],
